{{!
    @template local_oksigeniaeguahe/chat_family

    Who writes in the chat, among the families of the centre (chatpanel::find()): each household of Eguahe with
    whether it asks for a place, is a family of the centre or both, its children, how long it waits, who attends it,
    its next visit and its whole file; the families of the common record Eguahe does not have yet, with their children
    and groups; or that nobody was found, with a way to note a new family.

    Example context (json):
    {"families": [{"title": "Ana Ruiz y Pedro Gil", "centre": false, "kind": "both", "kindname": "Del centro y pide plaza",
     "children": [{"text": "Lucía: Infantil 3 años, visita hecha"}], "haschildren": true,
     "waiting": "Espera respuesta desde hoy a las 10:15", "owner": "La atiende Marta Pérez", "next": false, "url": "#"}],
     "hasfamilies": true, "school": [], "hasschool": false, "nobody": false, "newurl": false}
}}
{{#families}}
<article class="chat-hogar chat-{{kind}}">
    <p class="chat-sello">{{kindname}}</p>
    <h2 class="chat-nombre">{{title}}</h2>
    {{#centre}}<p class="chat-centro">{{.}}</p>{{/centre}}
    {{#haschildren}}<ul class="chat-hijos">{{#children}}<li>{{text}}</li>{{/children}}</ul>{{/haschildren}}
    {{#waiting}}<p class="chat-espera">{{.}}</p>{{/waiting}}
    {{#owner}}<p class="chat-dato">{{.}}</p>{{/owner}}
    {{#next}}<p class="chat-dato">{{.}}</p>{{/next}}
    <p><a class="boton secundario" href="{{url}}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{#str}}chat_open, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</a></p>
</article>
{{/families}}
{{#school}}
<article class="chat-hogar chat-centre">
    <p class="chat-sello">{{#str}}chat_kind_centre, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</p>
    <p class="chat-dato">{{#str}}chat_school_note, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</p>
    {{#haschildren}}<ul class="chat-hijos">{{#children}}<li>{{text}}</li>{{/children}}</ul>{{/haschildren}}
</article>
{{/school}}
{{#nobody}}
<div class="chat-aviso">
    <p>{{#str}}chat_nobody, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</p>
    {{#newurl}}<p><a class="boton secundario" href="{{.}}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{#str}}chat_nobody_new, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</a></p>{{/newurl}}
</div>
{{/nobody}}
